# {{title}} — agents layer (councils of personas)

Chartered review chambers per the HydraFlow methodology: personas as
versioned contracts, chambers with bounded decision rights, ADR-style
decision records, and per-persona calibration. Full pattern:
HydraFlow `docs/methodology/councils-of-personas.md` (reference implementation:
T-rav/harvestd `agents/`).

- `personas/` — one contract file per persona.
- `council/` — the general chamber contract + one charter per chamber.
- `council/decisions/` — one numbered record per adjudication.
